.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt DTLSV1_HANDLE_TIMEOUT 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm DTLSv1_handle_timeout
.Nd handle a pending timeout event for a DTLS or QUIC SSL object
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/ssl.h
.Ft int
.Fo DTLSv1_handle_timeout
.Fa "SSL *ssl"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn DTLSv1_handle_timeout
handles any timeout events which have become pending on a DTLS or QUIC
SSL object.
.Pp
Use
.Xr DTLSv1_get_timeout 3
or
.Xr SSL_get_event_timeout 3
to determine when to call
.Fn DTLSv1_handle_timeout .
.Pp
This function is only applicable to DTLS or QUIC SSL objects.
It returns 0 if called on any other kind of SSL object.
.Pp
.Xr SSL_handle_events 3
supersedes all use cases for this function and may be used instead of
it.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns 1 if there was a pending timeout event and it was handled
successfully.
.Pp
Returns 0 if there was no pending timeout event, or if the SSL object is
not a DTLS or QUIC object.
.Pp
Returns -1 if there was a pending timeout event but it could not be
handled successfully.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr DTLSv1_get_timeout 3 ,
.Xr SSL_handle_events 3 ,
.Xr ssl 7
